November 23, 2026

@drag0ooon - AI Launchpad | Early Stage

TapeLaunch is an AI launchpad on the TapeOutWorld DeWeb ecosystem where users turn ideas into onchain apps and tokens via AI agents. It launched its first project ANTB on Fourmeme and completed its first fee.

@ZonksFun - Memecoin Launchpad | Early Stage

Zonks is a memecoin launchpad and trading terminal for the LayerZero Zero ecosystem, offering one-stop launch and trade. It has announced an upcoming ZONKS token but the product is not yet live.

@TapeLaunch - AI Launchpad | Early Stage

TapeLaunch lets users describe an idea, have AI generate a DeWeb site or game on TapeOut, then launch a token via IGNIX on X Layer or Fourmeme on BNB Chain. It recently added a Telegram co-creation bot and.

@Mineliusfun - Solana Launchpad | Early Stage

Minelius is a Solana launchpad where each https://t.co/qpNTeQMPOU token gets a mining island and creator fees flow to holders privately via Helius Privacy Rings. Token launch and the island map are live, with the.

@UseGiftBall - Charity Launchpad | Early Stage

GiftBall is a Pump-based launchpad that routes part of creator fees into a community gift fund, with wallet-signed nominations, voting and receipt confirmation. The product is newly released and its.

@Bronk3r - NFT Launchpad | Early Stage

Bronker is an open NFT launchpad letting creators issue NFT collections with built-in economies holding BTC, ETH, stock tokens and stablecoins. It is running whitelist and partnership teasers ahead of its own.

@stormballtech - Token Launchpad | Early Stage

Stormball is a token launchpad combining buyback-and-lock, burn or liquidity, and holder airdrops in one platform. It recently detailed a 40/30/30 creator fee split, though neither product nor token.

@longyudynasty - NFT Marketplace | Early Stage

LongyuDynasty is an Eastern dragon-themed NFT marketplace on BNB Smart Chain supporting ERC-721/ERC-1155 minting, auctions, creator earnings and IPFS metadata. It is actively promoting its auction.

@RGB_Stone - Bitcoin NFT | Early Stage

RGBStone is a 9,000-piece NFT collection on the Bitcoin RGB protocol, backed by the SatSea RGB NFT marketplace. It plans a free mint limited to one per address for Ordinals and Runes holders.

@exolabs - AI Infrastructure | Early Stage

EXO Labs builds local frontier AI inference, clustering Mac Studios over RDMA to run large models. It is developing an Apple Silicon inference engine and automated agent pipeline, recently demoing fast.

@ClawBankETH - AI Agent Infrastructure | Early Stage

ClawBank builds financial infrastructure for AI agents, combining ERC-8004 agent wallet identity with ENS and trading Limitless prediction markets on Base. Its site is live via a decentralized.

@AmosMeiri - AI Compute Market | Early Stage

AntSeed is a decentralized AI inference liquidity market that has run for eight months with about 1T tokens served. It recently launched a Provider Staking Program and is teasing an upcoming ANTS token.

@oripaxyz - Onchain Collectibles | Upcoming Token Launch

https://t.co/kot5cydfQB brings Japanese physical card gacha packs onchain, awarding real cards or ORIPA tokens, with staking revenue share and a reserve pool planned. It debuts on Hyperliquid on November.

@AbraFiOrg - Tokenization Platform | Early Stage

AbraFi is Abra's Solana tokenization arm, offering the USDAF yield-bearing savings token backed by delta-neutral strategies with roughly 8 million USD in AUM. Its CEO has teased a major new project.

@colyseusagent - DeFi Automation | Mainnet

Colyseus Agent is a non-upgradeable Morpho collateral defense protocol on Robinhood Chain mainnet that auto-sells collateral or repays debt with USDG reserves before liquidation. Contracts are verified.

@AMPLIFY_XYZ - DeFi Trading Terminal | Early Stage

AMPLIFY is an onchain automated market-making terminal for Uniswap V2/V3/V4 on Base and Robinhood Chain, with built-in pause, gas reserve and slippage controls. It recently added a Clanker v5.

@SantaCoin2027 - Solana Memecoin | Upcoming Token Launch

Santa is a Christmas-themed Solana community project with a wallet-sign-in site where social tasks earn SOL rewards. Its SANTA presale on Pinksale has raised over 300 SOL.

@try_quotai - AI Compute Market | Early Stage

Quota AI is a marketplace for idle AI subscription capacity, letting users rent unused ChatGPT and Claude time and buyers access it via an OpenAI-compatible API. A QUOTA token is planned but not yet.
